//
// One layer's prefill of 64 rows (aie2_prefill_layer.py) on NPU2, at block
// 1 of a 256-row KV cache: the residual leaving the layer and block 1's KV
// rows bit-exact to llama_oracle.Layer.forward, every row.
// --synthetic-weights uses a seeded random layer and embed table.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, xrt_python_bindings, xrt_python_ctrl_scratchpad_bo
//
// RUN: %run_on_npu2% %python %S/test_prefill_layer.py --synthetic-weights --block 1 --t 256 | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: residual leaving the layer: 64/64 rows bit-exact
// CHECK: block 1's KV rows: 64/64 rows bit-exact
// CHECK: prefill layer, block 1: PASS
